<server description="Security authentication FAT configuration for jaas login module">

	<featureManager>
		<feature>appSecurity-1.0</feature>
		<feature>jsp-2.2</feature>
		<feature>securitylibertyinternals-1.0</feature>
	</featureManager>

	<!-- test WSLogin with proxy and custom login module -->
	<jaasLoginContextEntry id="system.DEFAULT" name="system.DEFAULT" loginModuleRef="hashtable,userNameAndPassword,certificate,token" />
	<jaasLoginContextEntry id="system.WEB_INBOUND" name="system.WEB_INBOUND" loginModuleRef="custom,hashtable,userNameAndPassword,certificate,token" />
	<jaasLoginContextEntry id="WSLogin" name="WSLogin" loginModuleRef="proxy,custom,hashtable,userNameAndPassword,certificate,token" />
	
	<jaasLoginModule id="custom" className="com.ibm.ws.security.authentication.fat.CustomLoginModule" controlFlag="REQUIRED" libraryRef="customLoginLib"/>    
    
	<library id="customLoginLib">
		<fileset dir="${server.config.dir}" includes="CustomLoginModule.jar"/>
	</library>

	<basicRegistry id="basic" realm="BasicRealm">
		<user name="user0" password="user0pwd" />
		<user name="user1" password="user1pwd" />
		<group name="group1">
			<member name="user0" />
			<member name="user1" />
		</group>
		<user name="user2" password="user2pwd" />
		<group name="group2">
			<member name="user2" />
			<member name="user6" />
		</group>
		<user name="user3" password="user3pwd" />
		<group name="group3">
			<member name="user3" />
		</group>
		<user name="user4" password="user4 pwd" />
		<group name="group4">
			<member name="user4" />
		</group>
		<user name="user5" password="user5pwd " />
		<group name="group5">
			<member name="user5" />
		</group>
		<user name="user6" password="user6pwd" />
	</basicRegistry>

	<application type="ear" id="jaasloginmodule" name="jaasloginmodule" location="${server.config.dir}/apps/jaasloginmodule.ear">
		<application-bnd>
			<security-role name="Employee">
				<user name="user1" />
				<group name="group1" />
			</security-role>		
			<security-role name="Manager">
				<user name="user2" />
				<group name="group2" />
			</security-role>
			<security-role name="AllAuthenticated">
				<special-subject type="ALL_AUTHENTICATED_USERS" />
			</security-role>
		</application-bnd>
	</application>

	<include location="../fatTestPorts.xml"/>

</server>
